OL,3,GNEWSACrash closes access to part of A1
OL,4,Ain Bedfordshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccess to part of the A1 in
OL,7,FBedfordshire has been closed after a
OL,8,Fserious collision on a nearby road.
OL,10,FPolice said the roundabout for the A507
OL,11,Fat junction 10 of the A1, for the
OL,12,FStotfold Interchange which is near
OL,13,FBaldock in Hertfordshire, was shut in
OL,14,Fall directions.
OL,16,FWriting on social media at 05:06 BST,
OL,17,FBedfordshire Police said the exit slip
OL,18,Froad at junction 10 of the northbound
OL,19,FA1 carriageway was also closed.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
